  "description": {
    "text": "One of the two half decks in the ADV Gift Box, a set for beginners released on 28 November 2003 with everything needed to play: two ready-built 30-card half decks, a coin, 30 damage counters, two markers, a playmat, a how-to-play book and a Pokémon Card Game CD-ROM that taught the rules on a computer. This deck is led by Latios ex, the other by Latias ex.",
